# The code map (graft/ on older repos, .trail/cache/ once a repo is on trail)
# is gitignored but should stay greppable: ripgrep reads .ignore before
# .gitignore, so both roots are re-admitted for search; only their large
# regenerable payload directories stay excluded.
!graft/
!.trail/cache/
graft/.cache/
graft/.graph/
.trail/cache/.cache/
.trail/cache/.graph/
